# License Information

This repository contains two types of content with different licenses:

## 1. Berean Standard Bible (BSB) Text - Public Domain

The **Berean Standard Bible text** contained in all output files (USFM and USJ formats) is dedicated to the **Public Domain**.

This includes all Bible text in:
- `results/` directory (USFM files)
- `results_usj/` directory (USJ files)
- All ZIP files generated in `workspace/`

### Public Domain Dedication

The Berean Standard Bible text is free of copyright restrictions and dedicated to the public domain. You are free to:

- ✅ Copy, distribute, and transmit the work
- ✅ Adapt and modify the work
- ✅ Use the work commercially
- ✅ Use the work for any purpose without restriction

**No attribution is required** (though appreciated).

**No permission is needed** to use the BSB text in any project, publication, software, or derivative work.

For more information about the Berean Standard Bible, visit: https://bereanbible.com


